  "instructions": [
    "Heat the grill to medium-high heat and char-grill the red bell pepper until tender.",
    "Sear the sliced Spanish ham for 1-2 minutes per side, until lightly browned.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the chicken broth over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until caramelized, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the marinated shrimp and cook until pink and cooked through.",
    "In a large paella pan or skillet, arrange the cooked ingredients in a circular pattern.",
    "Sprinkle the Spanish smoked paprika and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy the smoky and savory flavors."
